        "accession_number": "0001669162-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have organized our workflows, designed our systems and aligned our staff to provide superior service levels to brokers while achieving a level of efficiency that we believe provides us with a competitive advantage and helps contribute to our low expense ratio.",
        "start_character": 13096,
        "end_character": 13359
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001669162-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001669162-26-000015-1116f05b354bb67f",
        "accession_number": "0001669162-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We sell these insurance products in all 50 states, the District of Columbia, the Commonwealth of Puerto Rico and the U.S.",
        "start_character": 243,
        "end_character": 364
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001669162-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001669162-26-000015-1116f05b354bb67f",
        "accession_number": "0001669162-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Additionally, we are able to track quotes, monitor historical loss experience and reserve development, and measure other relevant metrics at a granular level of detail.",
        "start_character": 13509,
        "end_character": 13677
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001669162-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001669162-26-000015-1116f05b354bb67f",
        "accession_number": "0001669162-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Failure to comply with these laws and regulations would cause non-conforming investments to be treated as non-admitted assets in the states in which we are licensed to sell insurance policies for purposes of measuring statutory surplus and, in some instances, would require us to dispose of those investments.",
        "start_character": 57066,
        "end_character": 57375
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001669162-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001669162-26-000015-1116f05b354bb67f",
        "accession_number": "0001669162-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In order to attract and retain high-performing talent, we offer and maintain market-competitive compensation and benefit programs to all our employees.",
        "start_character": 75867,
        "end_character": 76018
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001669162-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001669162-26-000015-1116f05b354bb67f",
        "accession_number": "0001669162-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In states in which we operate on a non-admitted basis, general agents and their retail insurance brokers are often required to certify that a certain number of licensed admitted insurers had been offered and declined to write a particular risk prior to placing that risk with us.",
        "start_character": 50685,
        "end_character": 50964
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001669162-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001669162-26-000015-1116f05b354bb67f",
        "accession_number": "0001669162-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We also sell policies through our wholly-owned broker, Aspera.",
        "start_character": 17299,
        "end_character": 17361
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001669162-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001669162-26-000015-1116f05b354bb67f",
        "accession_number": "0001669162-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We also utilize internally developed agents.",
        "start_character": 27589,
        "end_character": 27633
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001669162-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001669162-26-000015-1116f05b354bb67f",
        "accession_number": "0001669162-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We believe we distinguish ourselves in the market with our contrarian risk appetite and our willingness to offer terms on risks requiring more extensive underwriting that some of our competitors may decline to consider.",
        "start_character": 12563,
        "end_character": 12782
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001669162-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001669162-26-000015-1116f05b354bb67f",
        "accession_number": "0001669162-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We compete with domestic and international insurers, some of which have greater financial, marketing and management resources and experience than we do.",
        "start_character": 45749,
        "end_character": 45901
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001669162-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001669162-26-000015-1116f05b354bb67f",
        "accession_number": "0001669162-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We designed the architecture for our information systems in a fashion that would allow us to reduce administrative costs and quickly provide us with useful information.",
        "start_character": 24994,
        "end_character": 25162
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001669162-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001669162-26-000015-1116f05b354bb67f",
        "accession_number": "0001669162-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
